usage: a_local_smith.py [-h] [--output OUTPUT] input

Exact Smith elimination over Z_(3), with both inverse transformations. All
entries are Fraction objects. The algorithm uses minimum valuation pivots and
records actual GL matrices over Z_(3), not merely modular data. It makes no
changes to the owned E82 computation.

positional arguments:
  input

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --output OUTPUT
